  "text": "proprium.sancti-laurentii-martyris-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Saint Lawrence, Martyr” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts fully offered to You, and, by the interceding merits of blessed Lawrence, Your Martyr, grant they may further our salvation. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
